    <h1>Accessibility</h1>

    <div class="notice-box">
      <p><strong>Draft for review.</strong> This page is a working draft prepared for internal review as part of the initial release of this website.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
    <p>Foreign Immigration Services aims for this website to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at Level AA, where reasonably practicable.</p>

    <h2>Known Limitations</h2>
    <p>This website is at an early stage of development. Some pages and features described on the <a href="/client-portal/">Client Portal</a> page are not yet built. As the website develops, this statement will be reviewed and updated.</p>

    <h2>Feedback</h2>
    <p>If you experience any difficulty accessing content on this website, please let us know at <a href="mailto:info@foreignimmigration.ph">info@foreignimmigration.ph</a>.</p>
